Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: PromoteStrConsts (atomized module) - promote source string-literal
    operands into IR.Const(string) instructions + ref usages, BEFORE local
    allocation (CollectVars/BuildVarMap) so the temp locals are registered.

